Package: colombia.mortalidad
Type: Project
Title: Predicting homicides from the sex ratio of all-cause mortality, Colombia 1985-2017
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Enrique", "Acosta", email = "eacosta@ced.uab.es", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Municipal zero-inflated negative binomial model of violent deaths
    on the all-cause mortality sex ratio, with a cause-of-death decomposition
    and a death-registration completeness analysis for Colombia 1985-2017.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: data.table, tidyverse, readxl, mgcv, glmmTMB, sf, colmaps, ggpubr
Remotes: nebulae-co/colmaps
Encoding: UTF-8
